(6652917, 994527, 94265, '<td valign="top">This will probably do very well since it''s a very well-taken shot and well-composed, I do like it and appreciate the quality of the image; however, it don''t fit the title for me personally, I see no obvious connection between blown out matches and the title of that book.</td>', 'This will probably do very well since it''s a very well-taken shot and well-composed, I do like it and appreciate the quality of the image; however, it don''t fit the title for me personally, I see no obvious connection between blown out matches and the title of that book.', '2012-01-23 11:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
