(6657408, 994162, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my top five -- what I really like is that every part of the title is represented: the boards, focus and solidity of the interior are "here"; the blur of the figure in motion disappearing into space and the endless sea and sky are "eternity"; and the open door, the gradually softening focus on the sand and beach beyond, and again the movement blur are "from . . to".  Well conceived and executed.</td>', 'One of my top five -- what I really like is that every part of the title is represented: the boards, focus and solidity of the interior are "here"; the blur of the figure in motion disappearing into space and the endless sea and sky are "eternity"; and the open door, the gradually softening focus on the sand and beach beyond, and again the movement blur are "from . . to".  Well conceived and executed.', '2012-01-28 21:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6657409, 994485, 138630, '<td valign="top">Perfect perspective for "on" the road and the black and white suits this so well.  Great texture in the road - love the crack in the asphalt.</td>', 'Perfect perspective for "on" the road and the black and white suits this so well.  Great texture in the road - love the crack in the asphalt.', '2012-01-28 21:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
