(6657412, 993258, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very polished looking portrait -- I like the naturalness of the skin texture and the deep red of the lipstick is the perfect shade.  I don''t usually mind borders of this sort and sometimes even like them, but I''m not crazy about its use here, especially on the top.  Still a very good score from me.</td>', 'Very polished looking portrait -- I like the naturalness of the skin texture and the deep red of the lipstick is the perfect shade.  I don''t usually mind borders of this sort and sometimes even like them, but I''m not crazy about its use here, especially on the top.  Still a very good score from me.', '2012-01-28 21:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
