(6657923, 994504, 62249, '<td valign="top">Slightly over sharpened (notice the obvious edge along the gutter), but I do like the texture of the tree branches.</td>', 'Slightly over sharpened (notice the obvious edge along the gutter), but I do like the texture of the tree branches.', '2012-01-29 14:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6657924, 993827, 62249, '<td valign="top">It''s a very good photo, but my eyes are drawn more to the model''s face and the orange wrap than to the red shoes. The shadow on the floor is excellent.</td>', 'It''s a very good photo, but my eyes are drawn more to the model''s face and the orange wrap than to the red shoes. The shadow on the floor is excellent.', '2012-01-29 14:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
