(6658551, 994249, 27812, '<td valign="top">My poorest ever score. Like I said; brave or stupid. The fact is that is my nice side. I do intend to show the real picture of this devastating disease soon. The pictures are taken as part of my record of suffering.<br/>Since I am suffering more daily and knowing nobody can carry on like this, I am even more adamant to go for the 200 entries. <br/>Thanks for looking. Brave is not stupid. I am brave.Thank you for every vote and every comment.</td>', 'My poorest ever score. Like I said; brave or stupid. The fact is that is my nice side. I do intend to show the real picture of this devastating disease soon. The pictures are taken as part of my record of suffering.Since I am suffering more daily and knowing nobody can carry on like this, I am even more adamant to go for the 200 entries. Thanks for looking. Brave is not stupid. I am brave.Thank you for every vote and every comment.', '2012-01-30 05:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
